    <string name="ts_footer_title">Passing strong integrity</string>
    <string name="ts_footer_body">1. Obtain a valid keybox XML from a trusted source. Keyboxes are not provided; you must find one yourself.\n2. Tap \"Import keybox\" and load the file.\n3. Open \"Manage target apps\" and select Google Play Services and Google Play Store.\n4. Set target mode to \"Leaf\" if your device has a working TEE, otherwise leave it as Auto.\n5. Recheck your Play Integrity status.\n\nAlways delete the existing keybox before importing a new one. If Google revokes a keybox, it may still allow passing up to device integrity even though strong integrity will fail.</string>
